# as MicPage (the section under Sound)
look material
setup python3 -I -c "import json,os;p=os.path.expanduser('~/.config/tessera/config.json');c=json.load(open(p));c.setdefault('controlCenter',{})['layout']=[];json.dump(c,open(p,'w'),indent=4)"
wait 2
ipc panels open controlCenter TESSERA-TEST
wait 1
ptr move 1700 406 sleep 50 down sleep 1100 up
wait 0.6
shot sound-page-mic
note Microphone section at the bottom
ipc panels close
